h, enough to sustain growth.","Free cash flow has compounded 16.9% a year over five years.","Forward indicators: a backlog worth 39% of annual revenue and deferred revenue up 14%.","Capex roughly matches depreciation (0.9x, 5.4% of sales), a maintenance pace.","Its Rule of 40 score is 35, below the 40 that marks a healthy growth business."],"own":["Insiders hold little stock (0.5%), and institutions hold 91%.","Insiders have only sold over the past year (22 sales, net $11.0M sold).","Shareholder yield is a modest 1.4% (1.4% in buybacks).","The share count has shrunk 0.6% a year over five years, steadily raising each holder's stake."],"people":["With about 17,021 employees, each generates about $591K of revenue, 1.5x the Healthcare median, and productivity has risen 15.2% a year.","That works out to $146K of free cash flow per employee.","CEO pay is $2.3M (4x revenue per employee).","Stock compensation averages $46K per employee."]},"profile":{"v":"AVOID","conv":66,"head":"Avoid: priced 295% above its fair value of $115.","pros":["Model rating BUY (composite 62, gates 16/26)","ROIC 21.1% vs WACC 10.9%","FCF margin 24.7%","Revenue grew 18.2%/yr over 5y","Net cash of $5.9B"],"cons":["Trades 295% above fair value of $115","P/E 54.8x vs sector 25.5x","EV/EBITDA 35.5x vs sector 15.7x","P/FCF 64.2x vs sector 23.7x","12-1 month momentum -26%"],"flags":["Priced 295% above its fair value of $115"],"need":[],"buy_below":97.54,"vc":{"base":114.75,"base_src":"dcf","bear":81.77,"bull":167.91,"alt_median":113.41,"n_alt":2,"gap":0.0118,"dispersion":0.4125,"level":"LOW","why":["models disagree (41% dispersion)"]},"med":{"pe":25.5,"ev_ebitda":15.7195,"pfcf":23.7283,"pb":3.5607,"roic":-0.1181,"gross_margin":0.5566,"fcf_margin":0.0285,"div_yield":0.014}},"ticker":"ISRG","date":"2026-11-06"}